BT /F1 9.5 Tf 45 639 Td (Software testing verifies that software meets requirements and identifies defects.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 45 626 Td (The Testing Pyramid advocates for a broad base of fast, automated Unit Tests,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 45 613 Td (followed by Integration Tests, and a smaller apex of End-to-End \(E2E\) UI Tests.) Tj ET
0.15 0.18 0.22 rg
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 45 595 Td (Unit Testing: Validates individual units/functions in isolation, isolating external) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 45 582 Td (dependencies using test doubles \(mocks, stubs, spies\).) Tj ET
0.15 0.18 0.22 rg
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 45 564 Td (Integration Testing: Validates interactions between integrated components \(e.g.,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 45 551 Td (Spring Boot repository talking to real MySQL database\).) Tj ET
0.15 0.18 0.22 rg
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 45 533 Td (System / E2E Testing: Validates the entire integrated system end-to-end against) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 45 520 Td (business specifications.) Tj ET
0.15 0.25 0.5 rg
