0.8 0.85 0.9 RG 0.75 w
45 488 m 567 488 l S
0.15 0.18 0.22 rg
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 45 474 Td (Black-Box Testing: Tests functionality without knowledge of internal code structure.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 45 461 Td (Techniques include Equivalence Class Partitioning \(dividing inputs into) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 45 448 Td (valid/invalid classes\) and Boundary Value Analysis \(testing extremes: min, min+1,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 45 435 Td (nominal, max-1, max\).) Tj ET
0.15 0.18 0.22 rg
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 45 417 Td (White-Box Testing: Tests internal logic, data structures, and control flow. Metrics) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 45 404 Td (include Statement Coverage, Branch/Decision Coverage, and Cyclomatic Complexity) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 45 391 Td (\(McCabe metric: V\(G\) = E - N + 2P\).) Tj ET
0.15 0.25 0.5 rg
